[
    {
        "text": "\u7b2c\u4e09\u5341\u4e8c\u5173\uff08\u524d\uff09",
        "tag": "header",
        "key": "title_test",
        "is_skippable": true,
        "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_cher_2",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$chernormal_intro",
        "key": "$chernormal_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-there are two enemies left!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're running toward the building to our east--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've already locked on to them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_grenade_n",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Argh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Bullseye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't we making too much noise?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There are a ton of explosions all over the city. I don't think they'll notice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you notified Dr. Kal'tsit yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I called her before the battle started.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's evidence that Reunion is conducting their operations in this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "I haven't hung up yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shouldn't we be a bit stealthier with our movements?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That Reunion member just now seemed to be using Detection-type Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have to strike first so that we don't give away our location.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "At least, we can't give these Reunion squads time to communicate with each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phew... It's finally over...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf, assess the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here, hold on to the comms device.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jessica, don't let your guard down yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course... I'm aware of that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "All right, all right. I won't mention it again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit, can you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Always could. Indeed, you can't afford to let your guard down yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Jessica, there might be an enemy behind you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uwaaah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
        "bfrom": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$b_char_rockexplo",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1002_nsabr_2"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-how did they... get behind me...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Eeehh??",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I can attack you from behind, that means you were too slow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_axe_h",
        "volume": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 5,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're fine for now, Dr. Kal'tsit. I've taken out the enemy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You really are fast...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "I couldn't even see how you managed to get over there and come back so quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "--Actually, I never even left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Projekt Red contacted me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are no signs of activity from the Reunion forces hiding in Lungmen.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "At this stage, it'd be best not to poke the hornet's nest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "By the way, according to the intel I've received from the other recon teams, there may a fairly substantial Reunion presence in the desert.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In other words, we're the ones who hit the jackpot?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "That does put a bit of pressure on us. We're also only a recon team after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's the case, we've already eliminated two Reunion squads so far...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you absolutely sure about the affiliation of the enemies we first exchanged fire with, Jessica?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah, there shouldn't be any mistake. I double checked before asking you to shoot.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...My bad. I was busy calculating the ballistic trajectory.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "What about the enemy's numbers?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't know the exact number.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf, how's it going over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the matter...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": 0,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go take care of it. Let me know right away if there's an issue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Will do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's... head over to her to see what's going on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$escape_intro",
        "key": "$escape_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1.5,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_6",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What happened?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...You two didn't feel it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? What...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The temperature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Now that you mentioned it... it does seem colder...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The temperature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Indeed. There's at least a five-degree difference compared to the temperature outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How could such fair weather... change so suddenly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Look above you. The weather hasn't changed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not the weather.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's coming from here. Come, feel this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...The walls of the ruins?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right. These walls are heat-absorbing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...No way?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Before we came, the heat absorption had probably already worn off.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's returning to the previous temperature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "But, why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who would leave behind something like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "name2": "char_193_frostl_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Reunion are the only ones who've been active in these parts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion? Could they... do something like this?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Infected...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I once heard of a certain legend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
